  m_text: "Tags: \r\n- High fat / High calories  - High protein\nHealth Advice: \r\nMost
    of the fat comes from butter & cream, swapping them for low fat Greek yogurt
    keeps the tang and creaminess while cutting fat and calories.\n\nPortions | Calories
    | Protein | Carbs | Fats\r\n      1 \t   468         42g       13g      28g\r\n     
    2 \t   936         84g       26g      56g\r\n      3           1404       126g     
    39g      84g\r\n      4           1872       168g      52g      112g\r\n     
    5           2340       210g      65g      140"
